"0:20.668">れ</span><span begin="0:20.668" end="0:20.828">る</span><span begin="0:20.828" end="0:21.128">陽</span><span begin="0:21.128" end="0:21.448">射</span><span begin="0:21.448" end="0:21.678">し</span><span begin="0:21.678" end="0:21.968">が</span><span begin="0:21.968" end="0:22.188">ま</span><span begin="0:22.188" end="0:22.538">た</span></p><p begin="0:22.773" end="0:23.943" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.773" end="0:23.213">何処</span><span begin="0:23.213" end="0:23.943">かへ</span></p><p begin="0:23.937" end="0:28.437" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.937" end="0:24.747">貴方</span><span begin="0:24.907" end="0:25.227">連</span><span begin="0:25.227" end="0:25.377">れ</span><span begin="0:25.377" end="0:26.017">去っ</span><span begin="0:26.017" end="0:26.167">て</span><span begin="0:26.167" end="0:26.527">し</span><span begin="0:26.527" end="0:26.867">ま</span><span begin="0:26.867" end="0:27.067">う</span><span begin="0:27.067" end="0:27.517">な</span><span begin="0:27.517" end="0:28.437">ら</span></p><p begin="0:28.767" end="0:31.437" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.767" end="0:29.037">I'm</span> <span begin="0:29.037" end="0:29.157">a</span> <span begin="0:29.157" end="0:29.697">lil'</span> <span begin="0:29.697" end="0:30.747">gold</span><span begin="0:30.747" end="0:31.437">fish</span></p><p begin="0:31.687" end="0:33.307" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.687" end="0:32.477">Swimmin'</span> <span begin="0:32.477" end="0:32.727">in</span> <span begin="0:32.727" end="0:32.937">your</span> <span begin="0:32.937" end="0:33.307">love</span></p><p begin="0:33.581" end="0:37.131" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.581" end="0:33.801">I'm</span> <span begin="0:33.801" end="0:34.021">your</span> <span begin="0:34.021" end="0:35.021">lil'</span> <span begin="0:35.021" end="0:36.031">gold</span><span begin="0:36.031" end="0:37.131">fish</span></p><p begin="0:37.104" end="0:41.274" itunes:key="L11" ttm: